{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16108130","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16108130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1610813001:1":{"text":"各位，小声点，我有个消息要和大家分享。","source_cn":"各位，小声点，我有个消息要和大家分享。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74BFBAC97AC0A2C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610813002:1":{"text":"怎么了，格墨文，你有什么发现？","source_cn":"怎么了，格墨文，你有什么发现？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0D03826EE1E5FE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610813003:1":{"text":"虽然不知道考试的内容，但据我一位朋友所说，这场考试单独行动比组队行动更有利。","source_cn":"虽然不知道考试的内容，但据我一位朋友所说，这场考试单独...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39D8073E5C629AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610813004:1":{"text":"咦？真的吗？","source_cn":"咦？真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD97B9CFB515FCE5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610813005:1":{"text":"嗯，我那位朋友是王子的近侍，他无意中听王子殿下说这次的考试设计非常巧妙，单人行动反而最为便利。","source_cn":"嗯，我那位朋友是王子的近侍，他无意中听王子殿下说这次的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3316A4AEA8597ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title